data swift_language_subject_note: String = "SWIFT, cited to The Swift Programming Language (verified live 2026-08-04 by fetching the cited locator and confirming its title and publisher from the response, per the D0 verify-or-refuse rule): swift.org describes 'The Swift Programming Language' (TSPL) as 'the authoritative reference for Swift', offering a guided tour, a comprehensive guide, and a formal reference of the language; Swift is maintained by Apple Inc. and published through swift.org. WHY swift.org AND NOT docs.swift.org: the docs.swift.org book pages render their content through JavaScript and returned no readable title to this fetch, so the locator carried here is the one that actually verified."

